      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I honestly really enjoy the freedom of VRChat, and I think banning an avatar because people associate it with a joke would be very limiting. It's not the avatar that causes the people. It's the people that cause the avatar. At a smaller scale people on vrchat have done similar things involving a trend of a certain avatar, and it's been done with default avatars! Banning the knuckles avatar would probably not solve anything over-all.",
      "viewerReactions": null
