      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "While I understand the annoyance, removal of such avatars would take away the freedom that you'd have in a thing like VRchat. Not everyone is abusive with such an avatar (Although some are) however you might have seen that people group up to raid with all kinds of avatars.. so if you'd remove one they would move to the other.\n\nJust because you don't like an avatar it doesn't mean it should be removed.. I think blocking these people would be your best option here.\n\nLastly but not at least it does attract a lot of people to VRChat.. some will get fed up with it too and then continue playing normally so there is a twist to all of it!",
      "viewerReactions": null
