  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "You are going to think this sounds salty but hear me out.\nThe only thing in my opinion that the knuckles have brought to this game is bad memes, trolling, spamming, grief, annoyance, and constantly having to block people. \nI have never once got enjoyment from anything related to it. It hasn’t bettered my or my friends experience by far. Every time we see a knuckles we outright block them because we don’t want to hear the clicks or the repeated phrases. It’s essentially spam. Yeah it’s great we have a block button but when Uganda itself has over 1,000 people in it now and there’s more pouring into other worlds, it’s more of a chore so I can actually enjoy the game. It’s become a cancer to the game and takes away from the immersive experience and RP.",
